      "name": "Allen",
      "created_at": "2024-11-26T00:38:46.074Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So it appears Plaid is a no go now.  I talked with them and from what I can gather, you need some expensive account.</p>\n<p>Is there any other way to link a US bank and pull transactions?  I want to go to an ERP to automate things and get away from manual importing of data.  Is anyone in the US linking their bank transactions to ERPNext?  If so, how?</p>",
